msgctxt "search2:search2_09F798CD_19DD_43E8_B229_4FF82C14F5C9"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫It was the first time I had found the courage to face my mother...⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫to open up to "
"her."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫母には――、⟪k:1⟫初めて向き合う決心をし……⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫自分の思いの丈を……、⟪k:4⟫綴った。"

#: search2:search2_C22AB7C5_BC01_4088_B00A_EC5515169C4A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6e96d2190d785b869fbf4a4aaaed6b669252e881c4b71ad3900afb421ab44c72
#. default-sha256: 74e3db1d1fd90aac2b2ae0cb9002f1b58bf45881368eb68082eb5f3584d1521b
msgctxt "search2:search2_C22AB7C5_BC01_4088_B00A_EC5515169C4A"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I wanted to show her who I was—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫convince her that I wasn’t cursed—"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫私が私であれるように、⟪k:1⟫証明をしようと思った。⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫私が呪われてなどいないと――"

#: search2:search2_D407B1CD_6B40_4B53_87C1_019F29EA57EC
